    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take this oath at 3rd level, you gain this @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.Item.8M7uOPhbTxoxxJSo]{Channel Divinity} option.</p><p>You can use your Channel Divinity to call on primeval forces to entangle a foe. As an action, you make spectral vines spring up and grasp at a creature you can see within 10 feet of you. The creature must succeed on a Strength or Dexterity saving throw (its choice) or be restrained. While restrained by the vines, the creature repeats the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a success, it frees itself and the vines vanish.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yt3J4f8bTKBCzpMG\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The save offers both abilities: the creature rolls the one it chooses. Use <em>Repeat Save</em> at the end of each of its turns, and remove the effect when it succeeds.</p></section>",
